---
import BlogPost from '../../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---
<BlogPost title="resume" date={new Date('2017-06-17')} slug="resume" tags="reading">
  <p class="intro">I work where production software meets AI reliability. These are two views of the same career, tuned for different teams.</p>

  <section class="resume-choice">
    <p class="eyebrow">Research-adjacent engineering</p>
    <h2>Evaluation &amp; Agent Reliability Engineer</h2>
    <p>For teams building coding-agent evaluations, graders, harnesses, and reliable measurement systems.</p>
    <p class="actions"><a href="/assets/june-kim-evaluation-resume.pdf">View résumé (PDF)</a> <span>|</span> <a href="/research">Research and receipts</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="resume-choice">
    <p class="eyebrow">AI-native product engineering</p>
    <h2>Senior Applied AI &amp; Reliability Engineer</h2>
    <p>For teams shipping agent workflows, retrieval systems, integrations, evaluation, and production infrastructure.</p>
    <p class="actions"><a href="/assets/june-kim-applied-ai-resume.pdf">View résumé (PDF)</a> <span>|</span> <a href="https://github.com/kimjune01">GitHub</a></p>
  </section>
</BlogPost>

<style>
  .intro {
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  .resume-choice {
    border-top: 1px solid currentColor;
    padding: 1.35rem 0 1.6rem;
  }

  .resume-choice h2 {
    margin: 0.15rem 0 0.55rem;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .resume-choice p {
    margin: 0.35rem 0;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.68;
  }

  .actions {
    margin-top: 0.8rem !important;
  }

  .actions span {
    padding: 0 0.35rem;
    opacity: 0.55;
  }
</style>
